- What was implemented: Created src/server/extract-image-urls.ts exporting `extractImageUrls(html:string):string[]`. Uses a single regex (`/<img\b[^>]+\bsrc\s*=\s*(?:"([^"]*)"|'([^']*)'|([^\s>]*))/gi`) to match all `<img src=...>` variants (double-quoted, single-quoted, unquoted). Filters to absolute http(s) URLs only, deduplicates with a Set, returns [] on empty input. Created test/extract-image-urls.ts (4 tests, node-platform): found, dedupe, skip non-http (data: / relative / protocol-relative), and none. Registered in test/run-all-tests.mjs.
