- **Learnings for future iterations:**
  - Workers runtime has no DOMParser — regex is the only parse option for server-side HTML.
  - The IMG_SRC_RE regex must reset `lastIndex = 0` before each call since it uses the `g` flag on a module-level variable; otherwise it retains position across invocations.
  - Match groups: `match[1]` = double-quoted, `match[2]` = single-quoted, `match[3]` = unquoted — use `??` chain for all three.
