Thread: https://ampcode.com/threads/
- What was implemented: Added a shared deterministic subscription rkey helper
  for AT Protocol feed subscription records. The helper canonicalizes feed
  URLs, hashes the canonical URL with SHA-256, returns a lower-case
  `feed.<hex>` rkey, and exposes a baseline AT Protocol record-key validator.
