  npx tapout`; `npx tsc --noEmit`; `npm run lint`; `npm test`
- **Learnings for future iterations:**
  - AT Protocol record keys allow only ASCII alphanumerics plus `.-_:~`,
    must be 1-512 chars, and cannot be `.` or `..`; lower-case keys are
    recommended.
