- What was implemented: Added `src/server/auth/dpop-proof.ts` with a
  WebCrypto DPoP proof JWT helper for persisted private JWKs and an
  access-token SHA-256 hash helper. Added focused tests that verify the
  header, request claims, optional `ath` and `nonce` claims, query/fragment
  stripping from `htu`, public-only header JWK, and ES256 signature
  verification with the header public key.
- Files changed: src/server/auth/dpop-proof.ts, test/dpop-proof.ts,
  test/run-all-tests.mjs, specs/prd.json, progress.log
- Verification: `npx esbuild ./test/dpop-proof.ts --bundle
  --platform=node --format=esm
  --external:./src/server/blurhash-runtime.js --external:stripe
  --alias:cloudflare:workers=./test/cloudflare-workers-stub.ts
  --alias:@sentry/cloudflare=./test/sentry-cloudflare-stub.ts |
  node --input-type=module | npx tap-spec`; `npx tsc --noEmit`;
